    "second_order_effect": "residue also changed what Mem0 WROTE. Derived own-items per unit fall from 220 to 63 as residue grows, because Mem0's add reconciles against existing memories and increasingly chose UPDATE or NOOP over ADD. Contamination reached the write path, not only retrieval."
  },
